## `> development_philosophy`

> **Software should work for the user — not the other way around.**

I care about:

- Privacy — minimize unnecessary data access
- User control — permissions should be explicit
- Modularity — systems should be replaceable and extensible
- Practicality — features should solve actual problems
- Transparency — understand what software is doing
- Performance — avoid unnecessary complexity and overhead
